    /// <summary>
    /// Datos de diario e historia propios de Hunk.
    /// Extraídos sin alterar contenido ni el orden de sus textos.
    /// </summary>
    internal static class HunkLore
    {
        internal static readonly string HunkEnglishLore =
            "[U.S.S. FIELD RECORDER — PARTIAL RECOVERY]\r\nLOCATION: PETRICHOR V / RALLYPOINT DELTA\r\nASSIGNMENT: RECOVE" +
            "R SEALED BIOLOGICAL MATERIAL\r\n\r\nBy the time the recovery unit reached Rallypoint Delta, the snow had bur" +
            "ied most of the distress beacon. Beneath a collapsed loading gantry lay a transport capsule bearing the " +
            "Umbrella insignia. Every twelve seconds, its damaged transmitter repeated the same warning: CONTAINMENT " +
            "FAILURE. The team had been given the coordinates and an extraction window. Only HUNK had been told which" +
            " case to retrieve.\r\n\r\nThe first sign that something was wrong came from the footprints. They led out of " +
            "the capsule, not toward it. The second came when the outer doors buckled inward. Something massive moved" +
            " between the abandoned cargo containers, dragging lengths of torn metal behind it. The team's gunfire sl" +
            "owed it, but did not stop it. HUNK counted the intervals between its charges, changed magazines, and mov" +
            "ed toward the inner compartment while the others covered the passage.\r\n\r\nThe field recorder captured thi" +
            "rteen seconds of shouted positions, two requests for medical assistance, and the detonation of a flash g" +
            "renade. The creature recoiled. HUNK crossed the gap before its vision returned, using his combat knife t" +
            "o cut through a tangled restraint and reach the case beneath the wreckage. The seal was intact. Its temp" +
            "erature indicator was not. He connected the case to a surviving coolant line and waited until the warnin" +
            "g light turned green. Only then did he secure it to his harness.\r\n\r\nOn his way back, the team's radio ch" +
            "annel was nearly silent. A rifle lay in the doorway, its ammunition spent. Beyond it, the creature had b" +
            "egun forcing its way through the damaged bulkhead again. HUNK did not try to kill it. He placed the last" +
            " charge against the door mechanism, withdrew to the far side, and brought the entire frame down between " +
            "himself and the thing behind it. The recorder caught the sound of collapsing steel. It did not capture w" +
            "hat happened on the other side.\r\n\r\nThe extraction craft lifted off before the storm closed in. Its manif" +
            "est listed one recovered container and one returning operative. Ground command requested a situation rep" +
            "ort on the rest of the unit. HUNK transmitted the case's integrity reading, the last known hostile posit" +
            "ion, and the coordinates of the lost personnel. There was no speculation in his report, and no attempt t" +
            "o make the outcome sound better than it was.\r\n\r\nThe operation was entered into the archive as a success." +
            " The recovery team was entered into a different file. Attached to both was the same final recording: a s" +
            "eat harness fastening, a weapon being made safe, and one brief confirmation from the only operative who " +
            "made it back.\r\n\r\n\"Objective secured.\"";

        internal static readonly string HunkSpanishLore =
